@echo off
cd /d "C:\Users\SubratoBiswas\trinamix-conversion-workbench"
echo Cleaning any git locks...
del /f /q ".git\index.lock" 2>nul
del /f /q ".git\HEAD.lock" 2>nul
echo Dropping tracked bytecode...
git rm -r --cached --ignore-unmatch backend/app/__pycache__ backend/app/services/__pycache__ backend/app/parsers/__pycache__ 1>nul 2>nul
echo Removing scratch files (QA renders, Excel lock files)...
rmdir /s /q "_qa" 2>nul
del /f /q "~$*.xlsx" "~$*.pptx" 2>nul
git rm -r --cached --ignore-unmatch _qa 1>nul 2>nul
echo Staging...
git add -A
echo Committing (no-op if nothing changed)...
git commit -m "A human decision now outranks everything, corrections reach the conversions that already exist, and the 30-Jul supplier corrections are in. Highest precedence for an analyst approval. apply_learned_to_conversion with force=true overrode EVERY approved mapping regardless of who approved it, so an analyst could correct a field in Mapping Review, approve it, generate, and find the library had quietly put its own value back with nothing on screen to say so. The screen and the file disagreed and the screen looked right, which is the most expensive shape of bug this tool can have. The engine stamps its own auto-approvals with approved_by learning-engine, so anything else in that field is a person, and a person now wins. Overridden was already protected; approved-by-a-human no longer is not. Corrections now reach CURRENT conversions, not only future ones. Capturing a learning always covered future conversions because they read the library when they are created; the ones already open did not, so a correction made today reached everything except the work in front of you. Approving or saving a mapping now fans the learning out to every sibling conversion of the same object, client and source system: still-suggested mappings and engine-approved ones are updated, anything a PERSON approved or overrode is left exactly as it is because two analysts can disagree and a library entry must not silently overwrite a colleague's decision, and affected outputs are marked stale rather than regenerated behind the analyst's back. The 30-Jul supplier corrections, twelve of them, seeded as client-scoped learnings and seeded LAST so the most recent instruction wins a clash. Six fields ship blank: Batch ID on all sheets, Supplier Name New, Inactive Date, Tax Reporting Name, and Procurement BU and Liability Distribution which are blank ON INSTRUCTION and say so in the file, because otherwise the next reader treats them as an oversight and fills them. Business Relationship is SPEND_AUTHORIZED. Delivery Method reads EMAIL when the remittance email column carries a value and FAX when the fax column does, email tested first because that is what preference to EMAIL means, and blank rather than a guess when neither does, since it is a coded column. Supplier Site is country code plus dash plus city, and keeps the guard that falls back rather than shipping a bare dash into a required unique key. Parent Supplier is a new SELF_LOOKUP rule type: take this row's Parent Vendor Id, find the row whose Internal Id equals it, and use that row's Name, blank when the parent is not in the extract, because an id where a name belongs looks populated and is wrong. The index is built once per generation rather than per row, since 7,495 vendors would otherwise be 56 million comparisons. Tax Organization Type closes a question I raised on 28-Jul and could not answer myself: whether the instance takes the Oracle code CORPORATION or the display value. The answer is the display value, C caps and the rest small, so the strategy now carries Corporation and Individual, and both are registered as protected values so no cleansing family re-cases them. That protection is not theoretical: legal-suffix standardisation once rewrote CORPORATION to Corp on 1,392 rows of a required field. Protected values are now harvested from every analyst-pinned file rather than the strategy alone, and an explicit protected_values list is honoured as the strongest signal, being the analyst naming exact strings as decisions. Alternate Name blanks when it merely repeats Supplier Name, which needs the finished frame to compare two columns and so runs as a frame rule. Supplier Name not populating is recorded as an open question rather than guessed at: it is a defect report, not a rule, and it needs the extract to diagnose. 458 tests over 38 files, run on the pinned pandas 2.2.3 and on 3.0.2."
echo Pushing...
git push origin main
echo.
echo ====== DONE - review the messages above, then press any key to close ======
pause
